装机 user 7/24 拍板: UI 严格用中文 文枢, 其他 code ID 保持 wenshu。

- L10 comment: WERMES wordmark → 文枢 wordmark
- L34: <span>WERMES AGENT</span> → <span>文枢 AGENT</span>
- L36: aria-hidden WERMES AGENT → aria-hidden 文枢 AGENT

AC 验证:
- grep WERMES apps/bootstrap-installer/src → 0 hits
- grep "HERMES AGENT" apps/bootstrap-installer/src → 0 hits
- grep 文枢 apps/bootstrap-installer/src → 13 hits (≥3)
- com.wenshu identifier 保留 (Cargo.toml name, tauri.conf.json id)
---
 apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/welcome.tsx | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/welcome.tsx b/apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/welcome.tsx
index 007b997e5..dd4e4e73b 100644
--- a/apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/welcome.tsx
+++ b/apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/welcome.tsx
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@ import { startInstall } from '../store'
  * Welcome screen.
  *
  * Mirrors the desktop's chat intro (apps/desktop/src/components/chat/intro.tsx):
- *   - WERMES wordmark rendered in Collapse Bold, uppercase, tracked
+ *   - 文枢 wordmark rendered in Collapse Bold, uppercase, tracked
  *   - mix-blend-plus-lighter so the type "glows" on the canvas
  *   - fit-text utility so the wordmark sizes itself to the column
  *
@@ -31,9 +31,9 @@ export default function Welcome() {
           }
         >
           <span>
-            <span>WERMES AGENT</span>
+            <span>文枢 AGENT</span>
           </span>
-          <span aria-hidden="true">WERMES AGENT</span>
+          <span aria-hidden="true">文枢 AGENT</span>
         </p>
 
         <p className="m-0 text-center text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-muted-foreground">
